{"title": "Damaged Dark Justiciar Armour", "pageid": 18603, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Damaged_Dark_Justiciar_Armour", "categories": ["Medium Armour", "Common items", "Discoverable Dark Justiciar set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Icon.png/300px-Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/9/99/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Damaged Dark Justiciar Armour image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Icon.png/300px-Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>A Medium Armour that is the degraded version of <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Mail\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Mail\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Mail\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Mail\">Dark Justiciar Mail</a>. It is part of the <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Set\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Set\">Dark Justiciar Set</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Though time has tarnished this armour's metal and cracked its leather, the black sheen of <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Shar's</a> symbol shines eternal from its chestpiece.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-ac-value\" style=\"grid-template-columns: 42px; 1fr\">\n<div><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/60px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/80px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 2x\"><img src